{"id":"placard","lemma":"placard","pos":"noun","rank":1802,"glosses":["a cupboard, cabinet or closet built against or into a wall","an advertisement that is injurious, seditious or in otherwise bad taste"],"ipa":"/pla.kaʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4c/Fr-placard.ogg/Fr-placard.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"placards"},"formAudio":{"placards":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d5/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-placards.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Le placard est plein.","en":"The cupboard is full.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1102743","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"full, full up"}]},{"text":"Mets-le dans le placard.","en":"Put it in the closet.","words":[{"g":"to put","l":"mettre"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Tu as regardé dans le placard ?","en":"Did you look in the cupboard?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to look at","l":"regarder"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Ne regarde pas dans mon placard.","en":"Don't look in my closet.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to look at","l":"regarder"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Il se cache dans le placard.","en":"He's hiding in the closet.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to hide","l":"cacher"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}